# BMAD Method tooling/installation (framework engine, skill definitions,
# workflow render cache) — not TaskFlow app code or SDD artifacts.
# `_bmad-output/` (specs, epics, planning docs) IS versioned — see above.
# `.github/workflows/` is the TaskFlow CI/deploy configuration and must stay
# versioned for GitHub Actions.
/.agents/
/.claude/
/.github/*
!/.github/workflows/
/_bmad/

# Spec de outro projeto (não-TaskFlow), fora do escopo deste repositório.
/_bmad-output/specs/spec-controle-chamados-ti/
